template top-level
   0  MakeClosure k0   ; #<template scale>
   1  GlobalDefine k1  ; scale
   2  Return
template scale  arity 1
   0  Fixnum 3
   1  Fixnum 0
   2  MakeBox 2        ; count
   3  Undefined
   4  Undefined
   5  LocalRef 2       ; count
   6  LocalRef 1       ; factor
   7  MakeClosure k0   ; #<template one>
   8  LocalSet 3       ; one
   9  LocalRef 3       ; one
  10  LocalRef 4       ; all
  11  MakeClosure k1   ; #<template all>
  12  LocalSet 4       ; all
  13  PatchFree 4 1 4  ; all.1 = all
  14  LocalRef 4       ; all
  15  LocalRef 0       ; xs
  16  TailCall 1
template one  arity 1  free 2
   0  FreeRef 0        ; count
   1  FreeRef 0        ; count
   2  BoxRef
   3  AddImm 1
   4  BoxSet
   5  Unspecified
   6  Pop
   7  LocalRef 0       ; x
   8  FreeRef 1        ; factor
   9  Mul
  10  Return
template all  arity 1  free 2
   0  LocalRef 0       ; xs
   1  JumpIfNot NullP →4
   2  Nil
   3  Return
   4  FreeRef 0        ; one
   5  CarLocal 0       ; xs
   6  Call 1
   7  FreeRef 1        ; all
   8  CdrLocal 0       ; xs
   9  Call 1
  10  Cons
  11  Return
